{"id":"wb-6-77","name":"天目山遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天目山遗址","text":"天目山遗址是一处位于中国江苏省泰州市姜堰区北部的古遗址。于2006年5月被列为全国重点文物保护建筑之一。\n遗址位于新通扬运河与姜溱河交汇处，遗址面积60余亩，繁荣期距今约3100年，是一座西周时期的古城。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86783789,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783789","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/40693f004d3ee546f4ea2174.jpg","title":"天目山遗址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/%E5%A4%A9%E7%9B%AE%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Howhowforever","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​天目山遗址","width":320,"height":427}}